tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/d6209801b27230da855c7c110bcc1e9d.webm?t=1754470274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/d6209801b27230da855c7c110bcc1e9d.mp4?t=1754470274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Comfortable Micro-Horror Feeling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfA moderately horrifying game atmosphere as you explore the hidden truth in the dark maps.<br>\u25cfReturn to childhood nightmares, with eerie atmospheres pervasive in everyday scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/bf9e9a4a464f5b776ac56e50495acf7e.poster.avif?t=1754470274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/bf9e9a4a464f5b776ac56e50495acf7e.webm?t=1754470274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/bf9e9a4a464f5b776ac56e50495acf7e.mp4?t=1754470274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense and Thrilling Adventure</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of those eerie monsters and use the correct methods to evade or defeat them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre monster designs that evoke deep-seated fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/aa8efdfe8c2e739f430ef0949cf6bb94.poster.avif?t=1754470274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/aa8efdfe8c2e739f430ef0949cf6bb94.webm?t=1754470274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/aa8efdfe8c2e739f430ef0949cf6bb94.mp4?t=1754470274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progressive Puzzle Solving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfPuzzles with just the right level of difficulty\u2014not too hard but still challenging.<br>\u25cfPuzzle-solving is closely integrated with the plot. Solve the puzzles and uncover the truth hidden beneath layers of mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/d6a7a054dc9c733db039eb1a9f505577.poster.avif?t=1754470274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/d6a7a054dc9c733db039eb1a9f505577.webm?t=1754470274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549190/extras/d6a7a054dc9c733db039eb1a9f505577.mp4?t=1754470274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A 3D side-scrolling adventure game, you will dive into a bizarre dark world and unlock the secrets hidden in it. Use the props you've earned to fight against a variety of sanity-shattering monsters and bosses, challenge creative decryption, explore chilling truths, and reveal your ultimate destiny..",
